ustainability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"USA"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental engineering"},{"text":"Water treatment"},{"text":"Air pollution"},{"text":"Environmental modelling"},{"text":"Environmental health"},{"text":"Climate and sustainability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international study, verify current university requirements, professional accreditation, tuition, funding and visa conditions before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Environmental Engineering offers several distinct career paths."},{"type":"h","text":"Path A — Water & Wastewater"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","Water/Wastewater Engineer","Senior Engineer","Treatment Plant Manager","Water Operations Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path B — Environmental Consulting"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","Consultant","Senior Consultant","Project Manager","Principal Consultant"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path C — EHS"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","EHS Engineer","EHS Specialist","EHS Manager","Corporate EHS Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path D — Sustainability"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","Sustainability Analyst","Sustainability Specialist","Sustainability Manager","Sustainability/Climate Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path E — GIS & Environmental Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","GIS Analyst","Environmental Data Analyst","Spatial/Environmental Specialist","Environmental Intelligence Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Path F — Research"},{"type":"flow","items":["Environmental Engineer","Research Assistant","M.Tech/M.S.","Research Engineer","PhD","Scientist/Professor"]}]},{"heading":"Future Environmental Engineering — 2030–2040","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Environmental Engineering is likely to become increasingly connected to climate, data and industrial technology."},{"type":"p","text":"Future proj